---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — ToolsSite"
  description="Learn about ToolsSite, a free collection of fast, privacy-friendly online tools."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">About ToolsSite</h1>

    <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        ToolsSite is a free collection of online tools built for speed, simplicity, and
        privacy. Every tool runs entirely in your browser — nothing is uploaded to a
        server, and no signup is required.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Why We Built This</h2>
      <p>
        Most online tools are cluttered with ads, popups, and unnecessary steps. We wanted
        something different: clean, fast tools that just work. No distractions, no account
        creation, no hidden limits.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><a href="/tools/word-counter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Word Counter</a> — count words, characters, and reading time</li>
        <li><a href="/tools/qr-generator" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">QR Code Generator</a> — create custom QR codes instantly</li>
        <li><a href="/tools/json-formatter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">JSON Formatter</a> — format and validate JSON data</li>
      </ul>
      <p>And more tools are on the way.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Our Principles</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Privacy first:</strong> your data never leaves your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Free forever:</strong> no paywalls, no forced signups.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast and simple:</strong> built for speed and ease of use.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Have feedback or suggestions? Visit our{' '}
        <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>{' '}
        to get in touch.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>